+  documented operation. The ones that are hardest to observe directly are pinned to a concrete
+  check: SR-013 and SR-019 to inspection of responses, process output, and stored records; SR-014
+  and SR-016 to negative and concurrent tests; FR-047 and SC-015 to a simultaneous-reader test.
+- **Ambiguity resolved without clarification markers**: Four points the input left open were settled
